{"5402790":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Austin lost in maze","steam_appid":5402790,"required_age":0,"is_free":true,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Austin: Lost in a Maze<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Austin wakes up trapped in a maze that seems to shift every time he turns around. With no map, no clear way out, and strange sounds echoing through the corridors, he must explore carefully, solve puzzles, and uncover the truth behind the place he’s been trapped in.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate winding passages, search for clues, and keep your bearings as the maze twists into something far more unsettling than it first appears. Every discovery brings Austin closer to an exit—and deeper into the mystery of why he’s there.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you guide Austin out before the maze closes in?<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a maze full of hidden paths and unexpected turns.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles and piece together clues to uncover the story.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay alert as the environment changes around you.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover secrets tucked away from the main route.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find your way out—or risk getting lost for good.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Austin: Lost in a Maze is an atmospheric adventure about exploration, problem-solving, and finding your way through the unknown.<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Austin: Lost in a Maze<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Austin wakes up trapped in a maze that seems to shift every time he turns around. With no map, no clear way out, and strange sounds echoing through the corridors, he must explore carefully, solve puzzles, and uncover the truth behind the place he’s been trapped in.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate winding passages, search for clues, and keep your bearings as the maze twists into something far more unsettling than it first appears. Every discovery brings Austin closer to an exit—and deeper into the mystery of why he’s there.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you guide Austin out before the maze closes in?<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a maze full of hidden paths and unexpected turns.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles and piece together clues to uncover the story.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay alert as the environment changes around you.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover secrets tucked away from the main route.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find your way out—or risk getting lost for good.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Austin: Lost in a Maze is an atmospheric adventure about exploration, problem-solving, and finding your way through the unknown.<\/p>","short_description":"Guide Austin through a twisting maze, solve puzzles, uncover hidden clues, and find a way out before the corridors swallow him whole.","supported_languages":"English<strong>*<\/strong><br><strong>*<\/strong>languages with full audio support","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5402790\/a64ef9fc0425379ef6321dd724902be8ad09f3a0\/header.jpg?t=1793754302","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5402790\/339ae188591bdbfe0e083f972dd3ac674a7aa2f2\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793754302","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5402790\/339ae188591bdbfe0e083f972dd3ac674a7aa2f2\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793754302","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Dual core 1.8 GHz (Intel Core i3 or AMD equivalent)<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 2048 MB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Any GPU with hardware acceleration (integrated graphics OK)<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 500 MB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> Any<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> Gamepad supported - great on Steam Deck. Keyboard, mouse, and touch controls also supported.<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"linux_requirements":[],"developers":["Austin"],"publishers":["Payouts Inc"],"package_groups":[],"platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":false},"categories":[{"id":2,"description":"Single-player"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"}],"genres":[{"id":"25","description":"Adventure"},{"id":"2","description":"Strategy"},{"id":"37","description":"Free To Play"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5402790\/6cf1a4c555d3ad666fd39986e2008cc57edeea9f\/ss_6cf1a4c555d3ad666fd39986e2008cc57edeea9f.600x338.jpg?t=1793754302","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5402790\/6cf1a4c555d3ad666fd39986e2008cc57edeea9f\/ss_6cf1a4c555d3ad666fd39986e2008cc57edeea9f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793754302"},{"id":1,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5402790\/e635f90fcd2ad20ec8c66c8bdc843c422be2a524\/ss_e635f90fcd2ad20ec8c66c8bdc843c422be2a524.600x338.jpg?t=1793754302","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5402790\/e635f90fcd2ad20ec8c66c8bdc843c422be2a524\/ss_e635f90fcd2ad20ec8c66c8bdc843c422be2a524.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793754302"},{"id":2,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5402790\/48848bdfceb2db137308ee3c107ec0380ac11201\/ss_48848bdfceb2db137308ee3c107ec0380ac11201.600x338.jpg?t=1793754302","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5402790\/48848bdfceb2db137308ee3c107ec0380ac11201\/ss_48848bdfceb2db137308ee3c107ec0380ac11201.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793754302"},{"id":3,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/s